# drawgen.py intermediates: the PDF is the orderable sheet and is committed, but
# build123d traces text into outlines, so the SVG and DXF of the same sheet come
# to ~13 MB for five parts.  Regenerate with hardware/mechanical/drawgen.py.
hardware/mechanical/drawings/*.svg
hardware/mechanical/drawings/*.dxf
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
.vitepress/dist/
.vitepress/cache/
*.freerouting.log
